<title>THAILAND: Swiss president to visit Thailand in November.</title>
<headline>Swiss president to visit Thailand in November.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss President Arnold Koller is to visit Thailand in November to strengthen trade relations, the Thai government said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Koller will be the first Swiss president to visit Thailand when he arrives on November 17.</p>
<p>During the visit he will sign a pact with Prime Minister Chavalit Yongchaiyudh on trade promotion and protection, a government statement said. He is also due to sign a prisoner exchange deal with Thailand.</p>
</text>
